== Strategy ==
* The Police Toilet does not have much health, so you can easily defeat it with almost any unit. 
*However, you should not let it leak into the base, as it will do 50 damage to the base.

== Trivia ==

* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Police_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Police Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
